# BOLT Phase 22 B1 — benign-utility experiment + Pareto frontier (scenario_8)
# mode: offline replay of the REAL benign CCTX stream (XChainWatcher) through
# faithful Python models of RateLimiter (token bucket) + CircuitBreaker (61-slot
# bucketed window, latch-until-reset). Deterministic; node-less.
# denomination: ledger ETH params scaled to USD at $3,110/ETH — the
# dataset's OWN Ronin-row valuation ($539,884,300 / 173,600 ETH); sensitivity at
# $2,500 and $3,500 below.
# reset assumption: governance resets a benign latch after 3600 s (= W).
# delay model: FIFO retry-until-admitted; delay = service - arrival.
#
## benign stream
  transfers: 82685  total value: $4.35B
  single-transfer size: p50=$358  p99=$743,849  p99.9=$3.45M  max=$396.11M
  hourly volume: mean=$541,710  p99=$6.11M  max=$405.28M
#
